{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "The board's QR code: hsn://pair/1?c=<code>&d=<chip id>, prefix exact. Parameters as a URL query (percent-decoding, + as a space); others are ignored; c and d each exactly once. c is read as a typed code (pairing-code.json). d is exactly 12 lowercase hex digits, the 6-byte chip id. qr is null when the text is not a board's QR code.",
  "cases": [
